## 9. Alur Kerja (Workflows)

### WF-001: Siklus Kehadiran & Sesi Kerja Granular
```
[User Arrives] → ARRIVED Event
  → [Scans QR / Taps NFC] → CHECK_IN Event (Divalidasi vs Work Schedule)
    → [Clicks Start Work on "My Day"] → WORK_STARTED Event
      → [Active Working Session with Integrity Tracking]
        → [Clicks Break / Scheduled Break] → BREAK_STARTED Event
          → [Clicks Resume] → BREAK_ENDED & WORK_RESUMED Events
            → [Schedule End Reached] → WORK_ENDED Event
              → (If Approved OT) → OVERTIME_STARTED → OVERTIME_ENDED Events
                → [Scans Out] → CHECK_OUT Event
                  → [System Processes XP Rules & Daily Aggregates]
```

### WF-002: Persetujuan & Eksekusi Overtime
```
Intern submits OT Request (Date, Requested Window, Justification, Task Ref)
  → Supervisor Reviews in Team Today / Portal
    → Decision: [REJECTED] → Notification to Intern
    → Decision: [APPROVED] → Approved OT Window registered in Schedule Engine
      → Intern works during approved window
        → System captures actual worked OT duration
          → System calculates: Actual OT × Configured Rate = Bonus XP + Monetary Reward
            → Financial credit routed to Deduction Engine → Personal Wallet
```

### WF-003: Project Marketplace, Delivery & Penyelesaian Bounty
```
Project Owner publishes Project (Requirements, Visibility, Capacity, Bounty Pool)
  → Candidate (Intern/Alumni) applies
    → System displays Skill Match % to Reviewer
      → Reviewer accepts candidate into Project Team
        → Project Team assigns Milestones & Tasks
          → Member works tasks via Work Sessions
            → Member submits Work Report + Verified Evidence
              → Reviewer reviews and approves Submission
                → Contribution Engine computes Actual Contribution %
                  → Supervisor adjusts & confirms Final Contribution %
                    → Gross Bounty calculated per member
                      → Deduction Engine evaluates Taxes & Fees
                        → Farewell Contribution routed to Batch Fund
                          → Net Distributable credited to Personal Wallet
                            → Ledger records immutable transaction
```

### WF-004: Penanganan Koreksi Kehadiran & Pengecualian
```
User detects missing event / anomaly (e.g. Forgot Checkout)
  → User submits Correction Request with reason & proof
    → Supervisor / Admin reviews in Approval Center
      → Decision: [REJECTED] → No change to records
      → Decision: [APPROVED] → System writes correction adjustment record
        → System recalculates Work Session, Violations, and XP
          → Audit log retains original and corrected event histories
```

